      "en": "Now there was a long war between Saul’s house and David’s house. David grew stronger and stronger, but Saul’s house grew weaker and weaker.",
      "ko": "사울의 집과 다윗의 집 사이에 전쟁이 오래매 다윗은 점점 강하여가고 사울의 집은 점점 약하여 가니라",
      "source_text_hash": "0f63b8c003a7ababc05b44d8dd6746b26c5583583bffbf1a48fb7c821d83ae3c",
      "translation_text_hash": "c2084c2689e116559e8bb6dca90687918a9d48ecd3fabaa0ad10a28dab0212e9",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
