      "en": "So Joab and Abishai his brother killed Abner, because he had killed their brother Asahel at Gibeon in the battle.",
      "ko": "요압과 그 동생 아비새가 아브넬을 죽인 것은 저가 기브온 전쟁에서 자기 동생 아사헬을 죽인 까닭이었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "b58a867f00cadb14d9f3e6d3a7bb0c4ff5c809550914c5cf0fa07450130b6f73",
      "translation_text_hash": "39baf578ee5842df5a768a675bf06030ad3ef68361eac3da2b51869b366430f6",
