      ],
      "en": "They buried Abner in Hebron; and the king lifted up his voice and wept at Abner’s grave; and all the people wept.",
      "ko": "아브넬을 헤브론에 장사하고 아브넬의 무덤에서 소리를 높여 울고 백성도 다 우니라",
      "source_text_hash": "25b343849fc46ad997c0ed3b8ce69f85cc2b16033580245f296da489508afb43",
      "translation_text_hash": "6a4552272d56e27b4fd186a21442804f418e246de1493ffdbe6385bd5fdd0cd8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
